{"id":"torrey:breastplate","source":"torrey","name":"Breastplate","slug":"breastplate","seeAlso":[],"entries":[{"text":"A part of defensive armour — 1Ki 22:34.","refs":[["1Kgs",22,34,22,34]]},{"text":"A part of the high priest’s dress — Ex 28:4.","refs":[["Exod",28,4,28,4]]},{"text":"Made of iron. — Re 9:9.","refs":[["Rev",9,9,9,9]]},{"text":"Bright and shining. — Re 9:17.","refs":[["Rev",9,17,9,17]]},{"text":"Materials of. — Ex 28:15; 39:8.","refs":[["Exod",28,15,28,15],["Exod",39,8,39,8]]},{"text":"Form and dimensions of. — Ex 28:16; 39:9.","refs":[["Exod",28,16,28,16],["Exod",39,9,39,9]]},{"text":"Made from the offering of the people. — Ex 35:9.","refs":[["Exod",35,9,35,9]]},{"text":"Had names of the tribes engraved on precious stones — Ex 28:17-21; 39:10,14.","refs":[["Exod",28,17,28,21],["Exod",39,10,39,10],["Exod",39,14,39,14]]},{"text":"Inseparably united to the ephod — Ex 28:22-28; 39:15-21.","refs":[["Exod",28,22,28,28],["Exod",39,15,39,21]]},{"text":"The Urim and Thummim placed in — Ex 28:30; Le 8:8.","refs":[["Exod",28,30,28,30],["Lev",8,8,8,8]]},{"text":"Worn as a memorial — Ex 28:29; Isa 49:16.","refs":[["Exod",28,29,28,29],["Isa",49,16,49,16]]},{"text":"Righteous judgment of Christ. — Isa 59:17.","refs":[["Isa",59,17,59,17]]},{"text":"Defence of righteousness. — Eph 6:14.","refs":[["Eph",6,14,6,14]]},{"text":"Defence of faith and love. — 1Th 5:8.","refs":[["1Thess",5,8,5,8]]}],"refCount":21}
